# Lychee ignore patterns - regex patterns for URLs to skip during link checking

# Localhost and local development URLs
https?://localhost
https?://127\.0\.0\.1

# Example and placeholder URLs used by the template
https?://example\.com
https://github\.com/owner/repo

# Release assets and Pages that exist only after the first release/deploy
https://github\.com/link-foundation/cpp-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template/releases/download/
https://link-foundation\.github\.io/cpp-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template

# Web Archive rejects automated checks despite serving browser requests
https://web\.archive\.org
